cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or tool, please cite it as below."
title: "SWHForest: A Structural Curation and Search Layer for Large-Scale Code Corpora"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
# The license below covers the code (MIT). The license of the released data
# (data/release/) is CC-BY-4.0, as stated in README.md.
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Syntactic feature tables, a sharded inverted AST index, and reproducible view
  manifests for a 40% uniform hash-selected sample of ten Stack-Edu languages
  (52.1M unique files, 340.6M definitions), keyed by Software Heritage blob_id
  and distributed without any source text, together with the swhforest Python
  package that builds and queries them.
